{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2016-meet-science2-24","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2016,"subject":"chemistry","number":24,"points":2,"unitId":"stereo","unitLabel":"유기 구조·입체화학","topic":"cis·입체·이성질체","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["stereo","organic_rxn","organic_properties"],"stem":"cis-2-Butene의 반응 A와 B에서 주생성물에 대한 설명 중 옳은 \n것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은? (단, 각 반응에서는 적절한 \n분리․정제 과정을 수행하였다.)\n반응 A :\n1) OsO4\n2) NaHSO3, H2O\n2) H3O+\n반응 B :\n1) mCPBA\n(mCPBA = m-chloroperoxybenzoic acid)\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 반응 A의 주생성물은 라세미 혼합물(racemic mixture)이다. \nㄴ. 반응 B의 주생성물인 두 이성질체의 끓는점은 같다.\nㄷ. 반응 A의 주생성물과 반응 B의 주생성물은 서로 부분입체\n이성질체(diastereomer) 관계이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]}],"answer":4,"acceptedAnswers":[4],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":771,"height":199,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,64.547,308.4,79.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-meet-science2-24/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":771,"height":219,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,161.747,308.4,87.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-meet-science2-24/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":13,"sourceRect":[430.12,153.453,759.1,451.882],"width":328.98,"height":298.429,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.68,64.547,308.4,79.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.68,161.747,308.4,87.6],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text"